      "title": "Quick Intro",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**STEP 1 - PRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY GENERATION**\n<br> Input a product reference image and an optional background to generate a product photography\n\n**STEP 2 - PRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY EDITS**\n<br> Input a product photography. Then right click and \"open mask editor\" to draw circles or lines as art direction notes, and reflect them in text prompts to edit the photo\n\n**STEP 3 - PRODUCT VIDEO GENERATION**\n<br> Input the final product photography to generate a hero shot of the product\n\n**All three steps are optional and can be used independently. Before running a step, bypass all nodes in the other two steps.**"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**STEP 1 - PRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY GENERATION**\n<br> Input a product reference image and an optional background to generate a product photography\n\n**STEP 2 - PRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY EDITS**\n<br> Input a product photography. Then right click and \"open mask editor\" to draw circles or lines as art direction notes, and reflect them in text prompts to edit the photo\n\n**STEP 3 - PRODUCT VIDEO GENERATION**\n<br> Input the final product photography to generate a hero shot of the product\n\n**All three steps are optional and can be used independently. Before running a step, bypass all nodes in the other two steps.**"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
